# Off the top of Big 3 with the special meter full: Left, Right, L held = Christ Air.
park soma
spawn big3
cmd 0 set skater.special 1
hold up 0..100
hold ollie 166..196
tap left 199
tap right 202
hold grab 204..276
run 440
expect event trickStart{trick=Christ Air} within 203..207
expect no event bail
